      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>“A Prayer for Transitions” was written by Rabbi Elliot Kukla. He writes that this prayer was written “for all adult transitions including gender as well as things like starting medication.” It was first published as “A Prayer for Transitioning Gender” in <tei:hi rend="italic">Where Healing Resides</tei:hi> (CCAR 2013), p. 45. A more specific blessing upon the occasion of a gender transition ceremony may be found here.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_41759_notes"/>
